            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.68</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Better replacements.</b> The Replace tool now uses a purpose-built inpainting model — new elements sit naturally in the scene, with no ghosting at edges, at a quarter of the previous cost.</li>
<li><b>Preview polish.</b> Space-drag panning works again in zoomed images, and arrow keys stay in the text field while typing an inpaint prompt.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
