        <item>
            <title>5.67</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 17:51:15 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>367</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.67</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.67</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Window buttons work again.</b> A recent macOS update made close, minimize and zoom unclickable; they respond normally now.</li>
<li><b>Precise inpainting.</b> When replacing, only the painted area changes — everything outside stays pixel-identical, and the new element blends inside the mask without cut or frayed edges.</li>
<li><b>Masks persist.</b> The painted mask stays after generating and reappears on the result, so you can adjust and rerun instead of repainting.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
